<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document" lang="en">FARMER: Flow AutoRegressive Transformer over Pixels</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname" lang="en">Guangting Zheng
</span></span>
